        "summary": "χmT versus T (Figure 5) shows weak antiferromagnetic coupling among the Gd(III) ions. The interaction estimated with the Curie–Weiss model is −2.1(1) K; adjoining Gd ions are doubly or triply oxygen-bridged.",
